# Scratch notes and generated handoffs.
#
# This used to be a blanket `*.md`, which silently made every document in the
# repo invisible to git -- README.md only survived because it was already
# tracked when that rule landed. The project's knowledge now lives in docs/ and
# .planning/, so the rule has to be specific about what is genuinely scratch.
HANDOFF*.md
*_Handoff*.md
*_HANDOFF*.md
NOTES.md
scratch/

